            "sid": "ISA 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu biseera ebyo, kyabazinga w'e Babilonia ng'ayetebwa Merodaki Baladani, mutabane wa Baladani, yaawulira nga Hezekia bwe yali alwaire era nga bwe yamala n'awona. Agho yaamughandiikira embaluwa, yaagigha abakwenda baagitwala, baatwaliraku n'ekirabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia yaabasangaalira, yaabalaga eby'obukombe bwe byonabyona ebyali mu iterekero: feeza, zaabu, obuwoowo, omuzigo ogw'omughendo, eby'okulwanisa, ni byonabyona ebyali mu materekero ge. Ghazira kintu waire ekirala kiti ekyali mu kisaagaati kye eky'obwakyabazinga oba mu bwakyabazinga bwe bwonabwona, ky'ataabalaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Isaia omulanzi yaidha eri kyabazinga Hezekia, yaamubuuza ati: “Abasaadha bano baviiriire gha okwidha y'oli era bakobye ki?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia yairamu ati: “Baviire mu nsi ya ghala, Babilonia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era Isaia yaamubuuza ati: “Baboine ki mu kisaagaati kyo eky'obwakyabazinga?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia yairamu ati: “Baboine ebiri mu kisaagaati kyange eky'obwakyabazinga byonabyona, ghazira kintu kiri mu materekero gange kye ntabalaze.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaia yaakoba Hezekia ati: “Wulira Musengwa Katonda Afuga Amagye ky'akoba, ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Manha ng'ekiseera kiidha kutuuka, byonabyona ebiri mu kisaagaati kyo eky'obwakyabazinga, n'ebyo badhaadha bo bye baatereka okutuusa buti, batwalibwe e Babilonia. Tighalibaagho waire ekirala kiti ekirisigalagho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'abandi ku batabane bo beene, balibatwala baabalaawa, baafuuka bagheereza ba mu kisaagaati ekya kyabazinga w'e Babilonia.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Hezekia yaakoba Isaia ati: “Musengwa Katonda by'ayogeire birungi.” Hezekia oyo yakoba atyo, kuba yalowooza mule ati: “Kasita mu bulamu bwange twidha kubanga mu miraala nga ghazira kitweraliikiriza?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
